[
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "01a7178f-585e-507a-bd64-d9bcc9ee6f4c",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "WORK FROM HOME POLICY\r\n\r\nPolicy Category: Work From Home\r\n\r\n1. Purpose\r\nThis policy outlines the eligibility, expectations, and process for employees working remotely on a regular or occasional basis.\r\n\r\n2. Eligibility\r\nEmployees who have completed their probation period (see the Probation Policy) and whose role does not require a fixed physical presence (e.g., front-desk, warehouse, or facilities roles) are eligible to work from home, subject to manager approval.",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "add19c8a-bfe0-50c4-96c2-ba791d54dc5d",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "6. Equipment and Expenses\r\nThe company provides a laptop and any role-specific software required to work from home. A one-time home office setup allowance may be claimed through the Reimbursement Policy, subject to the limits defined there.\r\n\r\n7. Expectations While Working From Home",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "928e7dba-4a0e-51fe-b2c9-1630bbf33081",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "7. Expectations While Working From Home\r\nEmployees working from home are expected to be reachable during standard working hours, attend scheduled meetings with video on where appropriate, and maintain the same productivity standards as in-office work. Repeated unavailability during working hours while marked as \"working from home\" may result in the arrangement being revoked.\r\n\r\n8. Manager Discretion",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "reimbursement_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Reimbursement",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/reimbursement_policy.txt",
      "_id": "62bd6788-fbda-56a4-aa58-a53a83cb9681",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "3. Home Office Setup Allowance\r\nEmployees eligible for the Work From Home Policy may claim a one-time home office setup allowance of up to 15,000 (local currency) within their first 3 months of eligibility, covering items such as a desk, chair, or monitor. Receipts are required for all claims.\r\n\r\n4. Internet and Mobile Reimbursement",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "probation_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Probation",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/probation_policy.txt",
      "_id": "0e566235-605f-56ba-a984-1715d87f7d9a",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "7. Benefits During Probation\r\nEmployees on probation are eligible for sick leave and casual leave on a pro-rated basis from their date of joining, but are not eligible to apply for work-from-home arrangements (see the Work From Home Policy) until confirmed, except with special manager approval.\r\n\r\n8. Training and Onboarding",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "127f0f55-0fbb-55e7-9d4b-b3c5ee086671",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "3. Standard Work From Home Allowance\r\nEligible employees may work from home up to 2 days per week as a standing arrangement, agreed with their manager. Employees are not permitted to work from home every day as a default arrangement; teams are expected to maintain in-office collaboration on at least 3 days per week unless the role is designated fully remote in the employment contract.\r\n\r\n4. Occasional Work From Home",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "holidays_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Holidays",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/holidays_policy.txt",
      "_id": "ea65b436-cab7-54b0-8722-8950ca5469ab",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "6. Interaction With Annual Leave\r\nAs noted in the Leave Policy, a public holiday that falls within a period of approved annual leave is not deducted from the employee's annual leave balance; the leave balance is automatically adjusted.\r\n\r\n7. Office Closure\r\nThe office (for employees not working from home) is closed on all declared public holidays. Employees working from home on such days are not expected to be reachable, the same as employees in the office.\r\n\r\n8. Regional Variations",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "5ae6de1d-e710-5c31-9f56-ff2d8518fdf0",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "4. Occasional Work From Home\r\nIn addition to the standing 2-day allowance, employees may request occasional additional work-from-home days (e.g., for a home repair appointment or a focus-heavy task) by informing their manager at least 1 day in advance via chat or email. These occasional requests are not tracked formally but should be reasonable in frequency.\r\n\r\n5. Fully Remote Roles",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "reimbursement_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Reimbursement",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/reimbursement_policy.txt",
      "_id": "972cfda0-9d8d-5a18-b325-a9674f28fefe",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "2. Eligible Expense Categories\r\nThe following categories are eligible for reimbursement, subject to the limits below: internet and mobile bills for remote work, home office setup (one-time), professional certifications relevant to the employee's role, business travel (see also the Travel and Expense Policy for trip-specific rules), and client entertainment pre-approved by a manager.\r\n\r\n3. Home Office Setup Allowance",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "code_of_conduct_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Code of Conduct",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/code_of_conduct_policy.txt",
      "_id": "63119ba1-7a5b-56cc-9937-4b5142f7a3b3",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "6. Use of Company Resources\r\nCompany equipment, software licenses, and systems are provided for work purposes. Reasonable personal use is permitted (e.g., checking personal email) provided it does not interfere with work duties or violate any other section of this policy.\r\n\r\n7. Reporting Violations",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Work From Home",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/work_from_home_policy.txt",
      "_id": "397b8d29-a587-54b1-a9e5-6c6467f3402d",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "8. Manager Discretion\r\nTeam managers retain discretion to temporarily suspend work-from-home arrangements for specific projects that require in-person collaboration, with at least 1 week's notice to affected employees where possible.",
    "type": "Document"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "metadata": {
      "source": "exit_process_policy.txt",
      "policy_category": "Exit Process",
      "gcs_path": "gs://hrpolicyrag/raw/hr-policies/exit_process_policy.txt",
      "_id": "bab257c7-3178-59d3-a365-4072944154de",
      "_collection_name": "hr_policies"
    },
    "page_content": "EXIT PROCESS POLICY\r\n\r\nPolicy Category: Exit Process\r\n\r\n1. Purpose\r\nThis policy describes the steps an employee and the company follow between resignation (or termination) and the employee's last working day.\r\n\r\n2. Resignation Submission\r\nEmployees who wish to resign must submit their resignation in writing through the HR portal, triggering the notice period described in the Notice Period Policy. The resignation is acknowledged by the manager and HR within 3 working days.\r\n\r\n3. Exit Interview",
    "type": "Document"
  }
]
